  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• When oil is hot, add vegetable gyozas, flat-side down, in a single layer.\n• Cook until starting to brown, 1-2 minutes. Add the water (watch out, it may spatter!) and cover with a lid (or foil).\n• Cook until the water has evaporated and gyozas are tender and softened, 4-5 minutes. Transfer to a plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a58cb6fd4e23d845507417f/step-56c4c900.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, thinly slice cucumber.\n• Thinly slice pear into wedges.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a58cb6fd4e23d845507417f/step-3784c710.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a small microwave-safe bowl, combine ginger lemongrass paste and a drizzle of olive oil. Microwave in 10 second bursts until fragrant.\n• SPICY! Use less sriracha if you’re sensitive to heat! Stir in soy sauce mix, sriracha and garlic aioli until combined.\n• In a large bowl, combine shredded wombok, mixed salad leaves, pear and cucumber. Add soy-ginger dressing and toss to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a58cb6fd4e23d845507417f/step-6ce32720.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide ginger wombok salad between bowls.\n• Top with veggie potstickers.\n• SPICY! Use less wasabi peas if you’re sensitive to heat! Sprinkle over wasabi peas and tear over coriander to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a58cb6fd4e23d845507417f/step-d7df4b30.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
